ZLCompressor for WebCLAP (ports/zl-compressor), all under ZL_WEBCLAP:

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- compress_controller.hpp, equalize_controller.hpp: ZLWebclapAccess (ports/zl-compressor/zl_compressor_access.h)
  as a friend, for the status and controls that cross over as frames; lufs_matcher.hpp: setDiff, for the
  stand-in's matcher
- curve_panel.cpp, equalize_panel.cpp, response_panel.cpp: no threads, so the two worker loops run one pass per
  repaint (CurvePanel::paintOverChildren) on the editor's thread instead of waiting for notify()
- compact_combobox: the kit's JUCE names the display areas userArea/totalArea and has no popup item tooltips
  (ZL's JUCE fork adds them)

